:"Next year I want to go to school in Beijing.","difficulty":1}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0022","rank":22,"lemma":"本","examples":[{"slot":3,"meaning_en":"measure word for books","sentence":"我买了两本中文书。","translation":"I bought two Chinese books.","difficulty":2}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0023","rank":23,"lemma":"本子","examples":[{"slot":3,"meaning_en":"notebook","sentence":"老师的本子在桌子上。","translation":"The teacher's notebook is on the table.","difficulty":1}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0024","rank":24,"lemma":"比","examples":[{"slot":3,"meaning_en":"compared with","sentence":"哥哥比我高一点儿。","translation":"My older brother is a little taller than me.","difficulty":2}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0025","rank":25,"lemma":"别","examples":[{"slot":3,"meaning_en":"don't","sentence":"上课了，别看手机了。","translation":"Class has started, don't look at your phone anymore.","difficulty":1}]}]}
/Users/moi/Desktop/business/learnly/corpus-generation/runs/new-hsk-1/raw/g1-batch-0001-0025.json:1:{"results":[{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0001","rank":1,"lemma":"爱","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"love","priority":1},{"meaning_en":"like","priority":2}],"notes":"A core verb for love and strong liking. It is common with people, food, and activities.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"love","sentence":"我爱妈妈，也爱爸爸。","translation":"I love my mom, and I love my dad too.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"like","sentence":"弟弟爱吃米饭，不爱吃肉。","translation":"My younger brother likes rice but doesn't like meat.","difficulty":2}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0002","rank":2,"lemma":"爱好","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"hobby","priority":1}],"notes":"Usually a noun meaning a hobby or favorite pastime. Keep it concrete and personal.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"hobby","sentence":"我的爱好是看书和听歌。","translation":"My hobbies are reading and listening to songs.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"hobby","sentence":"姐姐的爱好是打球和跑。","translation":"My older sister's hobbies are playing ball and running.","difficulty":2}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0003","rank":3,"lemma":"八","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"eight","priority":1}],"notes":"A basic number word. It often appears with time, counting, and quantities.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"eight","sentence":"我家有八个杯子。","translation":"We have eight cups at home.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"eight","sentence":"爸爸早上八点到学校。","translation":"Dad gets to school at eight in the morning.","difficulty":2}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0004","rank":4,"lemma":"爸爸","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"dad","priority":1},{"meaning_en":"father","priority":2}],"notes":"A common family word. In speech, people also often say 爸.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"dad","sentence":"我爸爸早上送我上学。","translation":"My dad takes me to school in the morning.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"father","sentence":"晚上爸爸在家看电视。","translation":"Dad watches TV at home in the evening.","difficulty":1}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0005","rank":5,"lemma":"吧","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"let's","priority":1},{"meaning_en":"suggestion particle","priority":2}],"notes":"Often softens a suggestion or invitation. It is very common at the end of a sentence.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"let's","sentence":"我们一起去商店吧。","translation":"Let's go to the shop together.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"suggestion particle","sentence":"太晚了，回家吧。","translation":"It's late, let's go home.","difficulty":1}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0006","rank":6,"lemma":"白","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"white","priority":1}],"notes":"A basic color word. It usually describes clothes, objects, or flowers.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"white","sentence":"我有一个白杯子。","translation":"I have a white cup.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"white","sentence":"桌子上有白花。","translation":"There are white flowers on the table.","difficulty":1}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0007","rank":7,"lemma":"白天","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"daytime","priority":1}],"notes":"Usually means the daytime, not the night. It is a common time word.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"daytime","sentence":"我白天在学校学习。","translation":"I study at school during the day.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"daytime","sentence":"白天妈妈常常在家。","translation":"Mom is often at home during the day.","difficulty":1}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0008","rank":8,"lemma":"百","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"hundred","priority":1}],"notes":"Used in counting, prices, and larger numbers. It often combines with 一 or other number words.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"hundred","sentence":"这个包一百元。","translation":"This bag costs one hundred yuan.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"hundred","sentence":"我们学校有一百个学生。","translation":"Our school has one hundred students.","difficulty":2}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0009","rank":9,"lemma":"班","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"class","priority":1}],"notes":"Most often this means a school class or homeroom. It is very common with numbers.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"class","sentence":"我们班有二十个学生。","translation":"Our class has twenty students.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"class","sentence":"哥哥在二班，我在一班。","translation":"My older brother is in Class Two, and I'm in Class One.","difficulty":2}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0010","rank":10,"lemma":"半","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"half","priority":1}],"notes":"Usually means half of something. It often appears before a measure word or in 一半.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"half","sentence":"我吃了一半面包。","translation":"I ate half the bread.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"half","sentence":"妈妈给我半个包子。","translation":"Mom gave me half a bun.","difficulty":1}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0011","rank":11,"lemma":"半年","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"half a year","priority":1}],"notes":"A common time expression. It is often used with study, work, or waiting.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"half a year","sentence":"我学汉语学了半年。","translation":"I studied Chinese for half a year.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"half a year","sentence":"爸爸在北京工作半年了。","translation":"Dad has worked in Beijing for half a year.","difficulty":2}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0012","rank":12,"lemma":"半天","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"half a day","priority":1},{"meaning_en":"quite a while","priority":2}],"notes":"It can mean a literal half day or, from context, a long while. Both uses are common.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"half a day","sentence":"妈妈在家忙了半天。","translation":"Mom was busy at home for half a day.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"quite a while","sentence":"我找了半天，找到本子了。","translation":"I looked for quite a while before finding the notebook.","difficulty":2}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0013","rank":13,"lemma":"帮","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"help","priority":1},{"meaning_en":"assist","priority":2}],"notes":"A common verb for helping someone do something. It is simple and very productive.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"help","sentence":"妈妈帮我找书包。","translation":"Mom helps me find my schoolbag.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"assist","sentence":"我帮弟弟拿书包。","translation":"I help my younger brother carry his schoolbag.","difficulty":1}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0014","rank":14,"lemma":"帮忙","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"help","priority":1},{"meaning_en":"assist","priority":2}],"notes":"Often used when asking for help or saying someone is helping. It sounds natural in daily life.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"help","sentence":"请你帮忙开门。","translation":"Please help open the door.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"assist","sentence":"爸爸在家帮忙做饭。","translation":"Dad is helping cook at home.","difficulty":2}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0015","rank":15,"lemma":"包","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"bag","priority":1},{"meaning_en":"package","priority":2}],"notes":"This can mean a bag or a package. Context usually makes the meaning clear.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"bag","sentence":"我的包在桌子上。","translation":"My bag is on the table.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"package","sentence":"爸爸拿回来一个包。","translation":"Dad brought back a package.","difficulty":2}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0016","rank":16,"lemma":"包子","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"bun","priority":1}],"notes":"A very common food word. It usually refers to a steamed bun.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"bun","sentence":"早上我吃了两个包子。","translation":"I ate two buns this morning.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"bun","sentence":"妈妈在家做包子。","translation":"Mom makes buns at home.","difficulty":1}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0017","rank":17,"lemma":"杯","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"cup","priority":1}],"notes":"Often used as a measure word for drinks. In English, it often translates as cup or glass.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"cup","sentence":"我想喝一杯茶。","translation":"I want to drink a cup of tea.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"cup","sentence":"爸爸喝了两杯水。","translation":"Dad drank two cups of water.","difficulty":1}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0018","rank":18,"lemma":"杯子","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"cup","priority":1}],"notes":"This is the usual everyday word for a cup. It names the object directly.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"cup","sentence":"桌子上有一个杯子。","translation":"There is a cup on the table.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"cup","sentence":"妈妈买了两个白杯子。","translation":"Mom bought two white cups.","difficulty":2}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0019","rank":19,"lemma":"北","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"north","priority":1}],"notes":"A direction word. It often appears alone on maps and in place words like 北边.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"north","sentence":"地图上边是北，下边是南。","translation":"On the map, the top is north and the bottom is south.","difficulty":2},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"north","sentence":"学校北边有一个商店。","translation":"There is a shop on the north side of the school.","difficulty":2}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0020","rank":20,"lemma":"北边","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"north side","priority":1}],"notes":"A common place word for the north side of something. It is often used after a location.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"north side","sentence":"学校北边有一个商店。","translation":"There is a shop on the north side of the school.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"north side","sentence":"我家在学校北边。","translation":"My home is north of the school.","difficulty":1}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0021","rank":21,"lemma":"北京","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"Beijing","priority":1}],"notes":"The capital city of China. It often appears with work, school, and travel.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"Beijing","sentence":"我爸爸在北京工作。","translation":"My dad works in Beijing.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"Beijing","sentence":"明年姐姐去北京上学。","translation":"My older sister will go to Beijing to study next year.","difficulty":2}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0022","rank":22,"lemma":"本","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"volume","priority":1},{"meaning_en":"copy","priority":2}],"notes":"A measure word for books and notebooks. It is usually used right after a number.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"volume","sentence":"我有两本课本。","translation":"I have two textbooks.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"copy","sentence":"姐姐买了三本书。","translation":"My older sister bought three books.","difficulty":1}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0023","rank":23,"lemma":"本子","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"notebook","priority":1}],"notes":"Usually this means a notebook for writing. It is a school-life word.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"notebook","sentence":"我的本子在桌子上。","translation":"My notebook is on the table.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"notebook","sentence":"弟弟买了一个新本子。","translation":"My younger brother bought a new notebook.","difficulty":2}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0024","rank":24,"lemma":"比","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"than","priority":1},{"meaning_en":"compare","priority":2}],"notes":"Used to compare two things. The basic pattern is A 比 B + adjective.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"than","sentence":"他比我高一点儿。","translation":"He is a little taller than me.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"compare","sentence":"今天比昨天冷一点儿。","translation":"Today is a little colder than yesterday.","difficulty":2}]},{"word_id":"new-hsk-1-0025","rank":25,"lemma":"别","meanings":[{"meaning_en":"don't","priority":1}],"notes":"Used before a verb to tell someone not to do something. It is common in daily speech.","examples":[{"slot":1,"meaning_en":"don't","sentence":"你别在路上跑。","translation":"Don't run on the road.","difficulty":1},{"slot":2,"meaning_en":"don't","sentence":"下雨了，别出去。","translation":"It's raining, so don't go out.","difficulty":1}]}]}
